      "content": "okay cool. i'm just a bit paranoid because when i was stepping through it, i thought i saw a edge case where the semaphore counter might desync if the callback fails mid-transaction. i know you said it was fine earlier, but just to be 100% safe... if we *did* have a race condition there, what would the actual impact be on the ledger? like, would it just cause a retry or could we end up with double-spending? i'd rather know now than fix a disaster tomorrow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
